Subject: [PATCH 8/8] xSignals: pad-to-pad signal paths, classes with length
 matching, panel, DRC and tuning target

- xSignal: path between two pads, also across series components (two-pin parts, resistor arrays)
- classes with matched-length (longest / member / fixed) and absolute length limits
- whole nets as class members: length matching of a group of nets
- xSignals panel in the PCB editor, create commands, analysis between components
- DRC test for xSignal classes; the length tuning tool takes its target from the class
- data in <board>.kicad_xsignals next to the board, board file format unchanged
- German translation
